<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <header>
      <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='conditions.html' class='active'>Ailments</a>
        <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
        <a href='pricing.html'>Rates</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
        <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class='glass'>
        <h1>Conditions we commonly support</h1>
        <p class='lead'>We partner with people across many concerns—helping you build practical daily supports, and offering optional therapeutic tools. Below are typical focus areas and how we frame support.</p>
      </section>

      <div class='grid' style='margin-top:14px'>
        <div>
          <div class='glass' style='padding:18px'>
            <div class='condition-item'>
              <h3>Sleep difficulties</h3>
              <p>We explore routines, light and movement cues, and supportive practices to reshape nightly rhythms. Suggestions may include behaviorally-focused steps and non-prescriptive aids.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='condition-item'>
              <h3>Digestive discomfort</h3>
              <p>Diet pattern review, gentle lifestyle shifts, and personalized guidance on supportive supplements when appropriate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='condition-item'>
              <h3>Chronic low mood or anxiety</h3>
              <p>Practical coping practices, pacing plans, and integration with other care providers when beneficial. We emphasize collaborative, non-judgmental support.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='condition-item'>
              <h3>Pain and mobility</h3>
              <p>Movement strategies, pacing, targeted self-care tools, and referrals to manual therapies or physical therapy if needed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='condition-item'>
              <h3>Hormonal transitions</h3>
              <p>Evidence-informed lifestyle adjustments, symptom tracking, and coordinated recommendations with primary clinicians.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='glass' style='margin-top:12px;padding:16px'>
            <h3>How we decide on supports</h3>
            <ol style='margin:8px 0 0 16px;color:var(--muted)'>
              <li>Understand your context and goals.</li>
              <li>Suggest small, testable steps with measurable targets.</li>
              <li>Offer optional tools and add-ons only where they align to your plan.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class='disclaimer'>
            Important: We do not promise cures. Information here is educational and supportive. Serious medical concerns or emergency situations require urgent medical attention. We work in concert with other healthcare providers and may recommend medical evaluation where appropriate.
          </div>

        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class='glass note'>
            <strong>What to expect at a first visit</strong>
            <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>A thoughtful intake, prioritized goals, and a short, achievable plan with optional at-home supports. We focus on clarity and small, meaningful shifts.</p>
            <div class='cta' style='margin-top:10px'>
              <a class='btn' href='book.html'>Check supportive options</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='glass note' style='margin-top:12px'>
            <strong>Safety & coordination</strong>
            <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>When care requires medical coordination, we will suggest collaborative steps and communicate with your permission to other clinicians.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section style='margin-top:18px'>
        <div class='glass'>
          <h3>FAQ — supportive framing</h3>
          <details style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)'><summary>Will this replace my current care?</summary>
            <div style='margin-top:8px'>No. Our approach is to complement and coordinate with existing care. For serious conditions, we recommend ongoing contact with your primary clinicians.</div>
          </details>
          <details style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)'><summary>What if I take medication?</summary>
            <div style='margin-top:8px'>We consider medication use when making suggestions and will not advise stopping any prescribed treatments. We can support conversations with prescribers when needed.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer style='margin-top:18px'>
      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>
        <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} · <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Contact: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>"}
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Method & process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071b1a;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#5ec3a7;--muted:#bcdad4;--text:#ecf7f3}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#042426);color:var(--text)}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none}
    nav a.active{color:var(--text);font-weight:700}
    .top{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
    .lead{color:var(--muted)}
    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    .step{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(94,195,167,0.03),transparent)}
    .step h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .retail{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .comparator{margin-top:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:4px;border-radius:999px}
    .toggle button{background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#05221d}
    .price{margin-top:10px;font-size:24px;font-weight:700}
    .cta{margin-top:16px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#36a48f);color:#02221c;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    footer{margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media (max-width:900px){.process{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='container'>
    <header>
      <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='conditions.html'>Ailments</a>
        <a href='approach.html' class='active'>Method</a>
        <a href='pricing.html'>Rates</a>
        <a href='about.html'>The Studio</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section style='margin-top:18px' class='card'>
        <h1 style='margin:0 0 6px 0'>A paced, test-and-learn method</h1>
        <p class='lead'>We prefer modest experiments over sweeping plans. Each step is measurable and reversible — so you can try something without feeling trapped by it.</p>

        <div class='process'>
          <div class='step'>
            <h4>Listen & map</h4>
            <p class='retail'>A focused intake that identifies what matters most to you now.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='step'>
            <h4>Try small steps</h4>
            <p class='retail'>Create 1–2 habits to test for 2–4 weeks.</p>
          </div>
